{"title":"Career Roadmap · Travel Consultant","role":"Travel Consultant","summary":"A Travel Consultant helps individuals, families, corporate clients, and groups plan, book, and manage travel. The role combines destination knowledge, itinerary design, transportation and accommodation booking, visa/documentation awareness, customer service, sales, travel technology, and increasingly data-driven travel personalisation.","facts":{"Current degree":"BHM / B.Sc Hospitality & Hotel Administration / BTTM","Course":"Tourism & Travel Management"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Timeline","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Tourism, geography and communication"}],[{"text":"Exploration"},{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Travel operations and booking systems"}],[{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Itinerary design, sales and travel technology"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Year 3–4"},{"text":"Travel Consultant / Travel Executive"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Independent client handling"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"Complex itineraries and corporate/group travel"}],[{"text":"Management"},{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Team and travel operations management"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"10–15 years"},{"text":"Travel business/operations leadership"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"15+ years"},{"text":"Head of Travel / Business Head / Entrepreneur"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Tourism foundation"},{"text":"Geography, destinations, communication"},{"text":"Destination portfolio"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Travel operations"},{"text":"Booking, itinerary planning, GDS concepts"},{"text":"Travel internship"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Professional consulting"},{"text":"Sales, visa awareness, costing, CRM"},{"text":"End-to-end travel project"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Business capability"},{"text":"Corporate travel, analytics, negotiation, leadership"},{"text":"Capstone + internship"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Tourism & Travel Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tourism industry structure"},{"text":"Travel agency operations"},{"text":"Tour operators"},{"text":"Domestic tourism"},{"text":"International tourism"},{"text":"Travel geography"},{"text":"Major tourist destinations"},{"text":"Tourism economics"},{"text":"Hospitality fundamentals"},{"text":"Transportation systems"},{"text":"Airline industry basics"},{"text":"Hotel accommodation categories"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"English"},{"text":"Business writing"},{"text":"Telephone communication"},{"text":"Email communication"},{"text":"Presentation skills"},{"text":"Customer interaction"},{"text":"Cross-cultural communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A travel consultant must be able to understand a client's requirements and convert them into a practical travel plan."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Travel Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how a complete trip is constructed."},{"type":"h","text":"Transportation"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airlines"},{"text":"Railways"},{"text":"Buses"},{"text":"Cruises"},{"text":"Car rentals"},{"text":"Transfers"},{"text":"Domestic vs international travel"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Accommodation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hotel categories"},{"text":"Room types"},{"text":"Meal plans"},{"text":"Hotel contracts"},{"text":"Cancellation policies"},{"text":"Check-in/check-out policies"},{"text":"Resort and destination properties"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Booking Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop awareness of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GDS systems"},{"text":"Airline reservation systems"},{"text":"Hotel booking systems"},{"text":"Online travel agencies"},{"text":"CRM systems"},{"text":"Tour operator platforms"},{"text":"Payment systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"GDS platforms can include systems such as Amadeus, Sabre and Travelport, depending on the employer and market."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Travel Consultant Specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"This is where you become job-ready."},{"type":"h","text":"Itinerary Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Domestic itineraries"},{"text":"International itineraries"},{"text":"Family holidays"},{"text":"Honeymoon packages"},{"text":"Adventure trips"},{"text":"Cultural tours"},{"text":"Business trips"},{"text":"Group tours"},{"text":"Student travel"},{"text":"Luxury travel"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"A client says:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"I want a 7-day international holiday for two people with moderate spending.\""},{"type":"p","text":"You should be able to determine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Destination","flights","hotel","transfers","sightseeing","activities","meals","insurance/documentation","total cost","contingency"]},{"type":"h","text":"Travel Costing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flight fares"},{"text":"Hotel costs"},{"text":"Transfers"},{"text":"Activity costs"},{"text":"Taxes/fees"},{"text":"Agent margins"},{"text":"Package pricing"},{"text":"Commission"},{"text":"Currency conversion"},{"text":"Cancellation costs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Basic formula"},{"type":"flow","items":["Package Price = Direct Travel Cost","Operating Costs","Taxes/Fees","Margin"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cost price"},{"text":"Selling price"},{"text":"Commission"},{"text":"Mark-up"},{"text":"Gross margin"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Travel Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop awareness of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passport"},{"text":"Visa"},{"text":"Travel insurance"},{"text":"Foreign exchange"},{"text":"Immigration requirements"},{"text":"Vaccination/health requirements where applicable"},{"text":"Hotel vouchers"},{"text":"Flight tickets"},{"text":"Travel confirmations"},{"text":"Cancellation/refund rules"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Visa and immigration requirements change frequently. A professional consultant should always verify current requirements through official government/embassy/immigration sources before advising a traveller."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation Options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Key Skills","Career Direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"Leisure Travel"},{"text":"Holidays, packages, destinations"},{"text":"Leisure Travel Consultant"}],[{"text":"Corporate Travel"},{"text":"Business travel, policy, expense"},{"text":"Corporate Travel Consultant"}],[{"text":"Luxury Travel"},{"text":"Premium experiences"},{"text":"Luxury Travel Advisor"}],[{"text":"MICE"},{"text":"Meetings, incentives, conferences"},{"text":"MICE Executive"}],[{"text":"Adventure Tourism"},{"text":"Outdoor activities, risk"},{"text":"Adventure Travel Consultant"}],[{"text":"International Travel"},{"text":"Visas, currencies, global destinations"},{"text":"International Travel Consultant"}],[{"text":"Cruise Tourism"},{"text":"Cruise products, ports"},{"text":"Cruise Travel Consultant"}],[{"text":"Religious Tourism"},{"text":"Pilgrimage planning"},{"text":"Religious Travel Consultant"}],[{"text":"Student Travel"},{"text":"Education destinations"},{"text":"Student Travel Advisor"}],[{"text":"Group Tours"},{"text":"Group logistics"},{"text":"Tour Operations Executive"}],[{"text":"Travel Technology"},{"text":"Booking/data/CRM"},{"text":"Travel Tech Specialist"}],[{"text":"Travel Analytics"},{"text":"Data and revenue"},{"text":"Travel Data Analyst"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships",