":"h","text":"Interview Questions"},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What does a travel consultant do?"},{"text":"How would you understand a client's travel requirements?"},{"text":"How would you design a 7-day itinerary?"},{"text":"What factors influence travel package pricing?"},{"text":"What is the difference between a travel agency and a tour operator?"},{"text":"What is a GDS?"},{"text":"What information is required for an international booking?"},{"text":"How would you handle a flight cancellation?"},{"text":"How would you handle an angry customer?"},{"text":"How would you increase the value of a travel booking?"},{"text":"How would you compare two hotels for a customer?"},{"text":"How do you calculate package margins?"},{"text":"How would you handle a last-minute itinerary change?"},{"text":"What factors should be checked before advising a traveller about visa requirements?"},{"text":"How would you sell a premium travel package?"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Hospitality/Tourism"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Tourism Management"},{"text":"MBA Hospitality Management"},{"text":"Master of Tourism Management"},{"text":"Master of Travel Management"},{"text":"MHM"},{"text":"Tourism Administration"},{"text":"International Hospitality Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business specialisation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Marketing"},{"text":"MBA International Business"},{"text":"MBA Operations"},{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"text":"MBA Entrepreneurship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics Route"},{"type":"p","text":"For technology-oriented students:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Tourism degree","Travel Operations","Excel","Power BI","SQL","Travel Analytics","Revenue/Business Analyst"]},{"type":"h","text":"Government & Public-Sector Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tourism departments"},{"text":"Sta