 rates"},{"text":"SLA management"},{"text":"Reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist Route 2 — Luxury Travel"},{"type":"flow","items":["Travel Consultant","Luxury Travel Advisor","Senior Advisor","Luxury Travel Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"Build expertise in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Luxury hotels"},{"text":"Private experiences"},{"text":"Villas"},{"text":"Cruises"},{"text":"Chauffeur services"},{"text":"Bespoke itineraries"},{"text":"VIP handling"},{"text":"Personalisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The value proposition shifts from booking travel to designing experiences."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist Route 3 — MICE"},{"type":"flow","items":["Travel Executive","MICE Executive","MICE Manager","MICE Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"MICE = Meetings, Incentives, Conferences and Exhibitions"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Event planning"},{"text":"Venue selection"},{"text":"Accommodation blocks"},{"text":"Group transportation"},{"text":"Delegation management"},{"text":"Vendor coordination"},{"text":"Event budgeting"},{"text":"Corporate client management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist Route 4 — Travel Analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["Travel Operations Executive","Travel Analyst","Senior Analyst","Travel Analytics Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Booking analytics"},{"text":"Revenue analytics"},{"text":"Demand forecasting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful metrics:"},{"type":"h","text":"Conversion Rate = Bookings ÷ Qualified Leads × 100"},{"type":"h","text":"Average Booking Value = Total Booking Revenue ÷ Number of Bookings"},{"type":"h","text":"Gross Margin = Selling Price − Direct Travel Cost"},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist Route 5 — Travel Entrepreneurship"},{"type":"p","text":"A travel consultant can eventually establish:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Travel agency"},{"t