ement"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Customer Retention"},{"text":"Supplier Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GDS"},{"text":"Booking platforms"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL — advantage"},{"text":"AI productivity tools"},{"text":"Digital marketing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Customer service"},{"text":"Cross-cultural awareness"},{"text":"Problem solving"},{"text":"Time management"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Crisis management"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Experience","Target Role"],"rows":[[{"text":"0–1 year"},{"text":"Travel Consultant / Travel Executive"}],[{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Senior Travel Consultant"}],[{"text":"3–5 years"},{"text":"Team Leader / Travel Supervisor"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Travel Operations Manager"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"Travel Manager / Business Manager"}],[{"text":"12–16 years"},{"text":"Head of Travel / Operations"}],[{"text":"16+ years"},{"text":"Business Head / Entrepreneur / Tourism Strategist"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, an ideal candidate should have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BHM/B.Sc Hospitality & Hotel Administration/BTTM"},{"text":"Strong tourism and destination knowledge"},{"text":"At least one meaningful travel-industry internship"},{"text":"End-to-end itinerary design capability"},{"text":"Travel costing and quotation skills"},{"text":"Booking/GDS exposure"},{"text":"Basic visa/documentation awareness"},{"text":"Strong customer communication"},{"text":"Sales and upselling capability"},{"text":"Excel proficiency"},{"text":"Basic Power BI"},{"text":"CRM familiarity"},{"text":"International travel awareness"},{"text":"One complete travel-package portfolio project"},{"text":"Understanding of sustainable t